"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="inc8" value="«include»" style="endArrow=open;endSize=10;dashed=1;html=1;strokeColor=#33475B;fontSize=11;fontColor=#33475B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="uc_devmgmt" target="uc_d_toggle"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="ext0" value="«extend»" style="endArrow=open;endSize=10;dashed=1;html=1;strokeColor=#33475B;fontSize=11;fontColor=#33475B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="uc_ack" target="uc_alarms"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="gen" value="generalisasi: Admin mewarisi semua hak akses Viewer" style="endArrow=block;endFill=0;endSize=14;html=1;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;strokeColor=#33475B;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#33475B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="actor_admin" target="actor_viewer"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1400" y="1025"/><mxPoint x="105" y="1025"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="notes" value="Catatan:&lt;br&gt;1. Semua use case selain Login mensyaratkan sesi login (JWT di cookie httpOnly). Tanpa login, halaman dialihkan ke /login.&lt;br&gt;2. Admin mewarisi seluruh use case Viewer (generalisasi). Batasan diterapkan di backend (401/403), menu admin hanya disembunyikan di frontend.&lt;br&gt;3. Admin tidak dapat menurunkan role, menonaktifkan, atau menghapus akunnya sendiri; minimal satu admin aktif harus tetap ada.&lt;br&gt;4. Admin pertama dibuat lewat CLI server: python -m app.cli create-admin (tidak ada registrasi publik)." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;fillColor=#FFFBEA;strokeColor=#D3A52C;spacing=10;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#33475B;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1059" width="1420" height="126" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
